#N canvas 40 40 1500 1200 12;
#X text 20 5 seq: AUX+E again = TEMPO / STEP page. STEP: a key writes the step under the cursor and advances;
#X text 20 25 AUX+A# rest - AUX+B clear (STEP page) - AUX+C5 seq on/off - AUX+A saves with the tape;
#X text 20 45 knobs (STEP): 1 cursor / 2 length / 3 gate / 4 swing. seqp: 0 length 1 gate 2 swing 3 on;
